    "Titles": {
        "eng": "YAT: The Space Patrol",
        "jpn": "YAT安心!宇宙旅行"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "In the year 5808, humanity has taken gigantic steps in the vast reaches of space. The innovation of the dimensional tunnel made intergalactic travel possible between any planet in the galaxy. Focused on the planet Earth, an adolescent teenager named Goro Hoshiwatari approaches the feeble travel agency known as \"Yamamoto Anshin Travel \" to find the whereabouts of his father who disappeared fifteen years ago. Upon arriving, Goro meets the YAT staff and the president's daughter Katsura Tenjouin, whom he falls in love with. After getting inadvertently involved in an accident, Goro finds himself drafted into the agency to compensate for the damage. While Goro tags along to still search for his father, his troubles turbulence from the various cash-making attempts along the tours to enka-singing space pirates and escaping the romance attempts of the Cosmolord Agency's heiress.",
        "jpn": "――次元トンネル――\r\nそれを使って誰もが手軽に太陽系外の星に宇宙旅行が出来る時代。\r\n\r\n行方不明の父ダイゴを捜す星渡ゴロー。手掛りは１枚の写真だけ……。 それが写された星に向かう為に、ゴローは弱小宇宙旅行会社“ＹＡＴ”のツアーに参加する。 その途中、不幸な事故(？)によって宇宙船を壊してしまったゴローは、タダ働き同然でコキ使われる事になる……。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "YAT"
    ],
